@startuml US114-SSD
autonumber
actor "ATCC / BO" as Actor
participant "AISafe System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> System: GET /api/flight-routes?originIata={O}&destinationIata={D}&page={p}&size={s}
activate System
System --> Actor: 200 OK (Paginated list of routes + HATEOAS links)
deactivate System
deactivate Actor
@enduml